---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout
  title="Copyright Policy & Citations"
  description="Copyright policy, cultural heritage rights, and scholarly citation guidelines for the Assamese Manuscript Archive."
  keywords="copyright policy, citation guidelines, manuscript rights, Assamese Manuscript Archive, academic citation, cultural heritage rights"
>
  <div class="py-28 px-4 sm:px-8 md:px-24 lg:px-40 max-w-5xl mx-auto">
    <div class="mb-12 text-center">
      <h1 class="font-display text-4xl md:text-5xl text-ink font-medium mb-4">
        Copyright &amp; Citation Policy
      </h1>
      <p class="text-body text-sm text-muted">
        Last Updated: September 30, 2026
      </p>
    </div>

    <div class="space-y-8 text-body leading-relaxed bg-[var(--color-bg-elevated)] p-8 sm:p-12 rounded-2xl border border-[var(--color-hairline)] shadow-sm">
      <section>
        <h2 class="font-display text-2xl text-ink font-semibold mb-3">1. Ownership of Cultural Heritage Assets</h2>
        <p>
          The original physical manuscripts, illustrated folios, artifacts, and traditional masks depicted on this website remain the spiritual and cultural property of <strong>Samaguri Satra, Majuli</strong>. The digital records, audio guides, website design, and documentation are held collaboratively by <strong>Girijananda Chowdhury University</strong> and <strong>Samaguri Satra</strong> under the ASTEC ITGA grant scheme.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h2 class="font-display text-2xl text-ink font-semibold mb-3">2. Fair Use for Research &amp; Education</h2>
        <p>
          Students, educators, and scholars are encouraged to use low-resolution images, transcripts, and information for non-commercial academic research, coursework, and lectures under Fair Use principles, provided full academic citation is provided.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h2 class="font-display text-2xl text-ink font-semibold mb-3">3. How to Cite This Archive</h2>
        <p class="mb-2">When referencing manuscripts, articles, or audio recordings from this repository in academic publications, please adopt the following citation standard:</p>
        <div class="p-4 bg-[var(--color-surface-soft)] rounded-lg font-mono text-xs sm:text-sm text-ink leading-relaxed border border-[var(--color-hairline)]">
          <p>Assamese Manuscript Archive. (2026). <em>[Title of Manuscript or Exhibit]</em>. Samaguri Satra Digital Collection, Girijananda Chowdhury University &amp; ASTEC. Retrieved from https://assammanuscriptarchive.com/audioplayer?id=[Artifact_ID]</p>
        </div>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h2 class="font-display text-2xl text-ink font-semibold mb-3">4. Commercial &amp; Publication Requests</h2>
        <p>
          High-resolution image licensing for print publications, documentary films, or commercial broadcasts requires formal written permission from the Project Coordinator and the custodians of Samaguri Satra. Inquiries may be addressed to: <a href="mailto:info@assammanuscriptarchive.com" class="text-[var(--color-primary)] hover:underline font-medium">info@assammanuscriptarchive.com</a>.
        </p>
      </section>
    </div>
  </div>
</BaseLayout>
